        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright (c) 2005 John Wiley & Sons, Ltd.",
        "AbstractText": "Intraclass correlation coefficient (ICC) estimates must be provided when reporting the results of a cluster randomized trial. This study demonstrates that estimating this parameter with one-way ANOVA and an underlying mixed-effects statistical model leads to biased estimates. The bias depends on the effect size of the studied treatment."
